          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: রাষ্ট্র",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "রাষ্ট্র — rāshṭrô — \"a nation-state; the state\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "রাষ্ট্রের প্রধান কাজ নাগরিকদের রক্ষা করা। rāshṭrer prôdhān kāj nāgôrikder rôkkhā kôrā. The main job of the state is to protect its citizens."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "রাষ্ট্র (rāshṭrô) is Sanskrit rāṣṭra, a kingdom or realm (Monier-Williams). Modern Bengali uses it for the state as a political body, beside দেশ, the country as a place."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
