          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "পরিচালনা করা — pôrichālônā kôrā — \"to run; to manage (an organisation)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "মীরা একটা ছোট স্কুল পরিচালনা করে। mīrā ekṭā chhoṭo skul pôrichālônā kôre. Mira runs a small school."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he/she …): তিনি কোম্পানিটা পরিচালনা করলেন, tini kompāniṭā pôrichālônā kôrlen."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "পরিচালনা করা (pôrichālônā kôrā) is a learned formation, probably Bengali, from Sanskrit pari- 'around' and cālana, moving or setting going (Monier-Williams): to keep a whole body moving. চালানো, to run a machine, is its everyday cousin."
            }
          ]
        },
